Mr. Sandals : Yes, .... (4) ....
Receptionist : Very good .... (5) .... If you need anything at all, please dial 0.

Select the best word/phrase to fill in blank (2).', '["do you have a credit card ?", "how much do you want to pay ?", "what kind of room would you like ?", "could I call you a taxi ?"]', '1', 'ข้อสอบจริง ก.พ. ปี 2561 ชุด Paper

2. ตอบ 1) do you have a credit card ?
