Mr. Sandals : Yes, .... (4) ....
Receptionist : Very good .... (5) .... If you need anything at all, please dial 0.

Select the best word/phrase to fill in blank (5).', '["we hope to see you on that day.", "Here is your room key, sir.", "Could I have a wake-up call at seven o''clock?", "Do come again, sir."]', '2', 'ข้อสอบจริง ก.พ. ปี 2561 ชุด Paper

