Miss Lee : Honestly, I want to gain more experience in a bigger organization.
David : I see. So, what skill or talents do you have that will be useful for the position of market researcher.
Miss Lee : ____(9)____.
David : That’s good to hear. ___(10)_____?
Miss Lee : No, not at all. The last job required me to work overtime sometime and I could handle it.

