INSERT INTO questions (id, question_text, choices, correct_answer, explanation, category, subject, difficulty, skill, catalogs, exam_year, exam_set, is_custom) VALUES ('2562_Paper_116', 'Read the following letter and select the best answer for each item.
TO : All staff
FROM : Management team
DATE : April 1, 2018
SUBJECT : Company’s Songkran event
Summer is here again. As you know, it is the tradition of our company to celebrate Thai new year together before we all take off our week long break during Songkran festival. There celebrations will be start with morning merit making and end with lunch on staff talent show.
DATE : April 9, 2018
PLACE : West side lawn
Merit marketing : 6.30 – 7.30 a.m.
Lunch and show : 10.00 a.m. – 3.00 p.m.
Food : Thai buffet with over 20 food stalls
Dress code : Colorful, Floral or, Traditional Thai dress.
We still need volunteers to help at the event. Please sign up with Khun Top at ext. 6291. Each team should also sign up for talent show with Khun Jang at ext. 6288. Great prizes are waiting for the most talented, the funniest, the most popular, and the most loving show!! See you all at the event.
Thank you,
Management team.

According to the memo, what is likely NOT TRUE ?', '["The company had a similar event the year before.", "Volunteers are welcome to help at the event.", "Some people will wear colorful floral shirts to the event.", "Each team should contact Khun Top to sign up for talent show."]', '4', 'ข้อสอบจริง ก.พ. ปี 2562 ชุด Paper

39. ตอบ 4) Each team should contact Khun Top to sign up for talent show.
According to the memo, what is likely NOT TRUE?
คำแปล : ข้อใดกล่าวไม่ถูกต้องเกี่ยวกับบันทึก
1. The company had a similar event the year before. บริษัทจัดงานคล้ายกับปีก่อนหน้า
2. Volunteers are welcome to help at the event. อาสาสมัครเต็มใจช่วยงาน
3. Some people will wear colorful floral shirts to the event.
บางคนจะใส่เสื้อลายดอกสีสันสดใสไปร่วมงาน
4. Each team should contact Khun Top to sign up for talent show.
แต่ละทีมควรติดต่อคุณ Top เพื่อลงทะเบียนการแสดงความสามารถ', 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', 'กพ ภาค ก', 0, 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', '["Reading"]', '2562', 'Paper', 0);
