INSERT INTO questions (id, question_text, choices, correct_answer, explanation, category, subject, difficulty, skill, catalogs, exam_year, exam_set, is_custom) VALUES ('2562_Paper_118', 'Read the following letter and select the best answer for each item.
Elementary schools are answer of integrated learning. It has been popular in some schools. Most of the teachers and parents agree to change standard curriculum to be integrated curriculum. Students do not need to focus only on textbook or computer. They can learn by doing activities such as cooking, plant, experiment, art and crafts. They will learn their skills through these activities in consequence of skill development in the future. When they go to the higher level, they can plan and choose suitable course.
In a class, Students will be encouraged to learn through both textbooks a activities that related to each other. They will learn and participate in a workshop. This part helps them to analyze, plan and do it by themselves. For example planting a tree make them learn to analyze the situation of growth from the textbooks and multimedia things, they will realize how to let the tree grow efficiently, then they plan the procedure of plant, finally they plant it. Teacher will give them some advice in every procedure to encourage them.

The most suitable title for this passage is ________.', '["learning change", "skill improvement", "integrated learning", "the popular school"]', '3', 'ข้อสอบจริง ก.พ. ปี 2562 ชุด Paper

41. ตอบ 3) integrated learning
The most suitable title for this passage is ________.
คำแปล : ชื่อที่เหมาะสำหรับบทความนี้คือ ________.
1. learning change การเรียนรู้ที่จะเปลี่ยนแปลง
2. skill improvement การพัฒนาทักษะ
3. integrated learning การเรียนรู้แบบผสมผสาน (การเรียนแบบเรียนรู้ด้วยตัวเอง+ครูแนะนำ)
4. the popular school โรงเรียนที่ได้รับความนิยม', 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', 'กพ ภาค ก', 0, 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', '["บทสนทนา"]', '2562', 'Paper', 0);
