Elementary schools are answer of integrated learning. It has been popular in some schools. Most of the teachers and parents agree to change standard curriculum to be integrated curriculum. Students do not need to focus only on textbook or computer. They can learn by doing activities such as cooking, plant, experiment, art and crafts. They will learn their skills through these activities in consequence of skill development in the future. When they go to the higher level, they can plan and choose suitable course.
