INSERT INTO questions (id, question_text, choices, correct_answer, explanation, category, subject, difficulty, skill, catalogs, exam_year, exam_set, is_custom) VALUES ('2562_Paper_121', 'Read the following letter and select the best answer for each item.
Elementary schools are answer of integrated learning. It has been popular in some schools. Most of the teachers and parents agree to change standard curriculum to be integrated curriculum. Students do not need to focus only on textbook or computer. They can learn by doing activities such as cooking, plant, experiment, art and crafts. They will learn their skills through these activities in consequence of skill development in the future. When they go to the higher level, they can plan and choose suitable course.
In a class, Students will be encouraged to learn through both textbooks a activities that related to each other. They will learn and participate in a workshop. This part helps them to analyze, plan and do it by themselves. For example planting a tree make them learn to analyze the situation of growth from the textbooks and multimedia things, they will realize how to let the tree grow efficiently, then they plan the procedure of plant, finally they plant it. Teacher will give them some advice in every procedure to encourage them.

What will students get from the workshop ?', '["They will analyze, plan and do the activity.", "They will know how to plan the tree.", "They will learn from textbooks and computers.", "They will get high grade."]', '1', 'ข้อสอบจริง ก.พ. ปี 2562 ชุด Paper

44. ตอบ 1) They will analyze, plan and do the activity.
What will students get from the workshop?
คำแปล : อะไรคือสิ่งที่นักเรียนได้รับจากการเรียนเชิงปฏิบัติการ
1. They will analyze, plan and do the activity. ได้วิเคราะห์วางแผน และทำกิจกรรม
2. They will know how to plan the tree. จะรู้ว่าปลูกต้นไม้ยังไง
3. They will learn from textbooks and computers. เรียนผ่านหนังสือและคอมพิวเตอร์
4. They will get high grade. ได้รับเกรดสูง', 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', 'กพ ภาค ก', 0, 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', '["บทสนทนา"]', '2562', 'Paper', 0);
INSERT INTO questions (id, question_text, choices, correct_answer, explanation, category, subject, difficulty, skill, catalogs, exam_year, exam_set, is_custom) VALUES ('2562_Paper_122', 'Read the following letter and select the best answer for each item.
Elementary schools are answer of integrated learning. It has been popular in some schools. Most of the teachers and parents agree to change standard curriculum to be integrated curriculum. Students do not need to focus only on textbook or computer. They can learn by doing activities such as cooking, plant, experiment, art and crafts. They will learn their skills through these activities in consequence of skill development in the future. When they go to the higher level, they can plan and choose suitable course.
In a class, Students will be encouraged to learn through both textbooks a activities that related to each other. They will learn and participate in a workshop. This part helps them to analyze, plan and do it by themselves. For example planting a tree make them learn to analyze the situation of growth from the textbooks and multimedia things, they will realize how to let the tree grow efficiently, then they plan the procedure of plant, finally they plant it. Teacher will give them some advice in every procedure to encourage them.

How does teacher encourage the students ?', '["Let the students plant the tree.", "Give the students some advice.", "Let the students think by themselves.", "Give the student some textbook and multimedia things."]', '2', 'ข้อสอบจริง ก.พ. ปี 2562 ชุด Paper

45. ตอบ 2) Give the students some advice.
How does teacher encourage the students?
คำแปล : คุณครูจะส่งเสริมการเรียนของนักเรียนได้อย่างไร
1. Let the students plant the tree. ให้นักเรียนปลูกต้นไม้
2. Give the students some advice. ให้คำแนะนำ ตามบรรทัดสุดท้ายในบทความ
3. Let the students think by themselves. ให้นักเรียนคิดด้วยตัวเอง
4. Give the student some textbook and multimedia things. ให้หนังสือหรือสื่อแก่นักเรียน', 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', 'กพ ภาค ก', 0, 'ภาษาอังกฤษ', '["บทสนทนา"]', '2562', 'Paper', 0);
